## @file
#  HYM8563 real time clock library for the Cubie A7A.
#
#  Backs EFI GetTime/SetTime with the HYM8563TS on S_TWI1 (PL12/PL13,
#  address 0x51) instead of the virtual clock this tree used to ship.
